<title>UK: Bankers Trust sets warrants on four currency pairs.</title>
<headline>Bankers Trust sets warrants on four currency pairs.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>BT Effecten GmbH has issued 1.2 million Quattro warrants, in four equal tranches, on four different currency shares, lead manager Bankers Trust International said.</p>
<p> WARRANTS     SPOT	  RANGE		 ISS PRICE</p>
<p> DEM/USD	1.5185	1.6000-1.4350     5.00 DEM</p>
<p> ITL/DEM	1000.0	1030.0-970.0	5.00 DEM</p>
<p> USD/GBP	1.64	  1.6900-1.5900     5.00 DEM</p>
<p> JPY/DEM	74.835	77.00-72.60	 5.00 DEM</p>
<p> MATURITY DATE   30.MAY.97		 PAYDATE	19.NOV.96</p>
<p> LISTING	   BER FFT DDF HAM STG   MIN EXER LOT 100</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
